Package: nvfancontrol
Version: 1.0.0
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: 841973620 <admin@841973620.net>
Depends: bash, kmod, make, gcc, util-linux
Suggests: dkms
Description: DGX Spark persistent EC fan sysfs controller
 The module exposes a fan sysfs attribute that accepts the 100% fan
 override, the EC automatic thermal policy, or an RPM floor. A helper
 daemon can drive the RPM floor from a temperature curve.
